{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "healthid-api-collection",
    "name": "Healthqor Health ID API",
    "description": "Spring Boot API for Health ID (56 endpoints).\n\n## Quick start\n1. Import **Health ID — Local** environment (`postman/HealthID-Local.postman_environment.json`).\n2. Run **Setup → Health Check** first — this sets the `XSRF-TOKEN` cookie.\n3. Run **Auth → Login** (admin credentials) before protected endpoints.\n4. All POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE requests auto-attach `X-XSRF-TOKEN` from the cookie.\n\n## Auth\n- Login sets HttpOnly cookies: `healthid_access_token`, `healthid_refresh_token`.\n- Enable cookies in Postman: **Settings → General → Cookies**.\n\n## CSRF troubleshooting\n- **403 Access denied** → run Health Check, then retry. Header value must be the cookie value only (not `XSRF-TOKEN=`).\n- **401 Invalid email or password** → wrong credentials or account not verified.\n\n## Roles\n- **CITIZEN** — profile, appointments, AI, Find Care\n- **DOCTOR** — `/api/doctor/**` (use Doctor Login)\n- **ADMIN** — `/api/admin/**` (default: `admin@healthid.lk` / `admin123`)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "challengeId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "doctorId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "patientId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "appointmentId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "let csrf = pm.cookies.get('XSRF-TOKEN');",
          "if (csrf && csrf.startsWith('XSRF-TOKEN=')) {",
          "  csrf = csrf.replace(/^XSRF-TOKEN=/, '');",
          "}",
          "if (csrf) {",
          "  pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-XSRF-TOKEN', value: csrf });",
          "}",
          "const method = pm.request.method;",
          "if (['POST', 'PUT', 'PATCH', 'DELETE'].includes(method)) {",
          "  pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Content-Type', value: 'application/json' });",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Setup",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check (get CSRF cookie)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/actuator/health",
            "description": "Run this before any POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE. Copies `XSRF-TOKEN` cookie used by the collection pre-request script."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
